 # todo
 
-A small CLI todo manager backed by a JSON file. `python -m todo.cli --file t.json add "x"`.
+A small CLI todo manager backed by SQLite by default (`~/.todo.db`, override with `--file` or the
+`TODO_FILE` env var). Paths ending in `.json` use the JSON backend instead, e.g.
+`python -m todo.cli --file t.json add "x"`.
+
+Copy tasks between backends with `migrate` (either direction, chosen by extension; the destination
+must be empty):
+
+```
+python -m todo.cli migrate t.json ~/.todo.db   # prints "migrated N tasks"
+```
+
+Rename a task with `rename ID TITLE`, e.g. `python -m todo.cli rename 1 "new title"`.
+
 Tests: `python -m pytest -q`.
